From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] public header: define size_t before declaring API

The installed oauth.h declares size_t parameters but does not include the
standard header that defines the type. This breaks a consumer that includes
oauth.h first, as detected by the target installed-RPM smoke test.

Patch-Source: openEuler RISC-V package CI run 36488700105
Patch-License: MIT
Upstream-Status: Not Submitted (automated upstream writes forbidden)
Remove-When: Upstream oauth.h includes stddef.h directly.
---
diff --git a/src/oauth.h b/src/oauth.h
--- a/src/oauth.h
+++ b/src/oauth.h
@@ -30,3 +30,5 @@
+#include <stddef.h>
+
 #ifndef DOXYGEN_IGNORE
 // liboauth version
 #define LIBOAUTH_VERSION "1.0.3"
